### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@organizationId = 1

### Get all organizations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations

### Search organizations by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations?search=lab

### Get organization by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/{{organizationId}}

### Create organization
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Central Lab Center",
  "description": "Main laboratory center for monitoring"
}

### Create second organization
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bio Research Lab",
  "description": "Organization for biological research laboratories"
}

### Update organization
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/{{organizationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Central Lab Center Updated",
  "description": "Updated laboratory center description"
}

### Delete organization
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/{{organizationId}}

### Validation error: empty name
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "description": "Invalid organization without name"
}

### Not found error
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/999999
